  "note": "50条动作话术。action 字段必须是普通人听完就能执行的中文指令，不要出现参数名。owner 字段由队友B校验和补充。",
  "categories": ["distance", "focal", "height", "angle", "light", "composition", "background"],
  "phrases": [
    {"id":"step_back","action":"后退两步","category":"distance","affects":["subject_ratio"],"delta_hint":"主体占比下降，环境进入画面","reason_template":"当前主体占比偏高，退后能让画面有呼吸感","condition_hint":"subject_ratio > 目标上限"},
    {"id":"step_back_more","action":"再退后三步，把全身带进来","category":"distance","affects":["subject_ratio"],"delta_hint":"从半身变全身","reason_template":"你需要交代人物和环境的关系，现在太近了","condition_hint":"主体被裁切"},
    {"id":"step_forward","action":"往前走一步","category":"distance","affects":["subject_ratio"],"delta_hint":"主体占比上升","reason_template":"主体太小，观众看不清表情","condition_hint":"subject_ratio < 目标下限"},
    {"id":"step_forward_close","action":"再靠近一点，只留肩膀以上","category":"distance","affects":["subject_ratio"],"delta_hint":"转成特写","reason_template":"情绪集中在脸上，需要更近","condition_hint":"情绪类意图且主体偏小"},
    {"id":"step_left","action":"往左边移两步","category":"distance","affects":["gaze_space","bg_complexity"],"delta_hint":"改变视线空间与背景","reason_template":"当前视线方向留白不够，左移能腾出空间","condition_hint":"gaze_space 不足"},
    {"id":"step_right","action":"往右边移两步","category":"distance","affects":["gaze_space","bg_complexity"],"delta_hint":"改变视线空间与背景","reason_template":"换个方向能避开背景杂物","condition_hint":"bg_complexity 偏高"},
    {"id":"orbit_subject","action":"绕到对象的侧面拍","category":"distance","affects":["gaze_space","light_angle"],"delta_hint":"侧脸轮廓更立体","reason_template":"正面太平，侧面能出轮廓光","condition_hint":"需要立体感"},
    {"id":"back_to_wall","action":"退到墙边，让背景干净","category":"distance","affects":["bg_complexity"],"delta_hint":"背景变简洁","reason_template":"背景杂物太多，换个位置一劳永逸","condition_hint":"bg_complexity > 0.5"},

    {"id":"longer_focal","action":"换成 3.2x 焦段","category":"focal","affects":["bg_complexity","subject_ratio"],"delta_hint":"背景虚化增强，主体更突出","reason_template":"长焦压缩背景，符合你要的虚化感","condition_hint":"背景虚化类意图"},
    {"id":"widest","action":"切回 1x 广角","category":"focal","affects":["bg_complexity","subject_ratio"],"delta_hint":"收进更多环境","reason_template":"要交代空间关系，广角比长焦合适","condition_hint":"风光/环境类意图"},
    {"id":"medium_focal","action":"用 2x 焦段","category":"focal","affects":["subject_ratio"],"delta_hint":"接近人眼视角，不变形","reason_template":"广角怼脸会变形，2x 更自然","condition_hint":"人像中景"},
